@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Devoluciones 10: POST /api/v1/refunds/:id/resubmit (El vendedor reenvía a aprobación)

actor "Vendedor" as Seller
participant "App Ventas / Web" as App
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Refund Workflow Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "refund_approval_levels DB" as LevelsCfgDB
participant "refund_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "refund_workflow_instances DB" as InstanceDB
participant "refund_workflow_instance_levels DB" as LevelsDB
participant "refund_workflow_actions DB" as ActionsDB

Seller -> App: Tap en "Enviar a aprobación"
App -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/refunds/1004/resubmit\n(ResubmitDto: { comment })
Gateway -> Service: resubmitRefundOrder(refundOrderId: 1004, payload, actor)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findRefundOrderWithInstance(1004)
OrdersDB --> Service: order { total: 200.00, current_workflow_instance_id: 56 }

Service -> InstanceDB: 2. findInstance(56)
InstanceDB --> Service: instance { status: 'EDITING', attempt: 1 }

Service -> Service: 3. assertResubmittable(order, instance, actor)
note right of Service
  409 si instance.status != 'EDITING'
  403 si el actor no es el vendedor dueño
  422 si el total quedó en 0
end note

Service -> LevelsCfgDB: 4. findActiveApprovalLadder(order.total)
note right of LevelsCfgDB
  La escalera se recalcula con el total NUEVO:
  al recortar cantidades, la nota puede
  necesitar menos niveles que antes.
end note
LevelsCfgDB --> Service: ladder[]

Service -> TX: 5. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> LevelsDB: 6. insertInstanceLevelsSnapshot(56, ladder)
note right of LevelsDB
  - nivel 1 con decision_mode =
    'DOCUMENT_DECISION' (nunca ITEM_SELECTION:
    la selección ya ocurrió en la original)
  - status = 'IN_PROGRESS', started_at = NOW()
  - niveles siguientes en 'PENDING'
end note
LevelsDB --> Service: levelIds[]

Service -> InstanceDB: 7. updateInstance(56, 'IN_APPROVAL', currentLevelOrder: 1)
InstanceDB --> Service: ok

Service -> ActionsDB: 8. insertWorkflowAction(56, NULL, 'SELLER_RESUBMITTED')
note right of ActionsDB
  - previous_status = 'EDITING'
  - new_status = 'IN_APPROVAL'
  - amount_before = 400.00
  - amount_after = 200.00
  - system_summary = 'El vendedor recortó
    la nota a Bs 200,00.'
end note
ActionsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> TX: 9. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (ResubmitResult:\n{ instanceStatus: 'IN_APPROVAL', currentLevelOrder: 1, total })
Gateway --> App: 200 OK
App --> Seller: Nota enviada • Nivel 1 en revisión
@enduml
